{
  "id": "alg8-c5-s1-n31",
  "card_id": "alg8-c5-s1-n31",
  "chapter": "第五章 指数函数",
  "section": "§11. 指数函数的性质",
  "number": "31",
  "title": "函数 $y=2^x$",
  "printed_title": "31. 函数 $y=2^x$",
  "start_page": 198,
  "start_printed": 191,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "tbl-p0199-01",
      "label": "表",
      "page": 199
    },
    {
      "id": "fig-71",
      "label": "图 71",
      "page": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "fig-72",
      "label": "图 72",
      "page": 201
    },
    {
      "id": "fig-73",
      "label": "图 73",
      "page": 201
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 14,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们在整数集合上讨论过由公式 $y=2^x$ 给出的函数的性质（参看第27小节）. 引进有理数指数幂的概念以后，现在可以在有理数的集合上讨论由同一个公式给出的函数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们每次相隔 $\\frac{1}{4}$（$x$ 的每一个值取成比它前面一个值大$\\frac{1}{4}$）列出函数 $y=2^x$ 的数值表.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{2}\\approx1.414,$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以 $2^{\\frac{1}{4}}=(2^{\\frac{1}{2}})^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{\\sqrt{2}}\\approx\\sqrt{1.414}\\approx1.189^*$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "知道了式 $2^{\\frac{1}{2}}$ 和 $2^{\\frac{1}{4}}$ 的值，我们再来求式 $2^{\\frac{3}{4}}$ 的值. 得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2^{\\frac{3}{4}}=2^{\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}}=2^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\cdot2^{\\frac{1}{4}}\\approx1.414\\times1.189\\approx1.681.$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "类似地，可以计算表中列出的其他 $x$ 值对应的函数值.例如：$2^{\\frac{3}{2}}=2^{1+\\frac{1}{2}}=2\\cdot2^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx2\\cdot1.414=2.828;$ $2^{-\\frac{1}{4}}=2^{-1+\\frac{3}{4}}=2^{-1}\\cdot2^{\\frac{3}{4}}\\approx0.5\\times1.681=0.8405;$ $2^{-\\frac{3}{2}}=2^{-2+\\frac{1}{2}}=2^{-2}\\cdot2^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx0.25\\times1.414=0.3535.$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 191,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0198#11",
        "p0199#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把求出的式 $2^x$ 的值四舍五入到百分位后，填入下面的数值表：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "$x$: $-2$，$-1\\frac{3}{4}$，$-1\\frac{1}{2}$，$-1\\frac{1}{4}$，$-1$，$-\\frac{3}{4}$，$-\\frac{1}{2}$，$-\\frac{1}{4}$，$0$，$\\frac{1}{4}$ $y$: $0.25$，$0.30$，$0.35$，$0.42$，$0.50$，$0.59$，$0.71$，$0.84$，$1.00$，$1.19$ $x$: $\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\frac{3}{4}$，$1$，$1\\frac{1}{4}$，$1\\frac{1}{2}$，$1\\frac{3}{4}$，$2$，$2\\frac{1}{4}$，$2\\frac{1}{2}$，$2\\frac{3}{4}$，$3$ $y$: $1.41$，$1.68$，$2.00$，$2.38$，$2.83$，$3.36$，$4.00$，$4.76$，$5.66$，$6.72$，$8.00$",
      "id": "tbl-p0199-01",
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "容易看出，在上表中列出的变量 $x$ 任何一个值对应于式$2^x$ 一个正值，并且 $x$ 的较大的值对应于式 $2^x$ 较大的值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来证明，在有理数集合上由公式 $y=2^x$ 给出的函数具有下列性质：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1) 函数只取正值，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2) 函数是增函数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "性质1的证明 由有理数指数幂的定义得出，$x$ 是任何有理数时，式 $2^x$ 取正值，也就是说，函数的任何值都是正数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "性质2的证明 设 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 是任意两个有理数，并且 $x_2>x_1$. 我们来证明 $2^{x_2}>2^{x_1}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "大家知道，可以用不同的方法把一个有理数写成整数与自然数的比.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0199#10",
        "p0200#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 写成分子是整数、分母是相同的自然数的分数. 就是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x_1=\\frac{k}{n},x_2=\\frac{m}{n}$，其中 $n\\in N,k\\in Z,m\\in Z$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据 $x_2>x_1$ 的条件，这就表示 $m>k$. 由此得出 $2^m>2^k$，因为在整数集合上，函数 $y=a^x$ 当 $a>1$ 时是上升的.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们得到 $2^m>2^k$. 又因为函数 $y=\\sqrt[n]{x}$ 在自然数的集合上是上升的，所以由此得出：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\sqrt[n]{2^m}>\\sqrt[n]{2^k}$，也就是 $2^{\\frac{m}{n}}>2^{\\frac{k}{n}}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-71",
      "label": "图 71",
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是，如果 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 是有理数，并且 $x_2>x_1$，那么 $2^{x_2}>2^{x_1}$，也就是说，函数 $y=2^x$ 在有理数集合上是增函数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把上表中列出坐标的点描在坐标平面上. 这些点可以连接成位于横坐标轴以上的一条曲线（图71）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "减小数值表中自变量取值的间隔后，将得到落在同一条曲线上并且排列得更加密集的图象上的点. 图72中，描出了每相隔 $\\frac{1}{8}$ 取变量 $x$ 的一个值时函数 $y=2^x$ 的图象点.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图71",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 71",
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0200#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-72",
      "label": "图 72",
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-73",
      "label": "图 73",
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图72",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 72",
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图73",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 73",
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们将不作证明而承认下述事实：存在一个定义在实数集合上的增函数，这个函数和我们在有理数的集合上所讨论的函数相同，它由公式 $y=2^x$ 给出. 这个函数的值域是正数集合. 它的图象是图73中所画出的曲线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "值得注意的是，这就表示我们约定象 $2^{\\sqrt{3}}$、$2^\\pi$ 以及一般地$2^\\alpha$（$\\alpha$ 是无理数）这种表示式都认为有意义. 利用函数 $y=2^x$ 递增的性质，可以找出用2的有理数指数幂表示的界限，使式 $2^\\alpha$的值处于这个界限内.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，可以找出式 $2^{\\sqrt{3}}$ 的值所处的界限：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为 $1<\\sqrt{3}<2$，所以$2^1<2^{\\sqrt{3}}<2^2,$因为 $1.7<\\sqrt{3}<1.8$，所以$2^{1.7}<2^{\\sqrt{3}}<2^{1.8},$因为 $1.73<\\sqrt{3}<1.74$，所以$2^{1.73}<2^{\\sqrt{3}}<2^{1.74}$ 等等.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0201#8",
        "p0202#1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
